	(text "CONDOR CAB-SIM INSERT  -  plugs between main-board J6 and the VOLUME pot pigtail (no cuts on Rev A)\nJ1 <- SH cable (pin-1-to-pin-1) from main-board J6: pin3 = SECOND_STAGE_OUT (recovery out), pin2 = wiper (OUT), pin1 = VMID\nJ2 <- volume pot pigtail: pin3 = pot top (CAB_OUT), pin2 = wiper (passes straight back to J1.2), pin1 = pot bottom (VMID)\nWatchdog tap (WD_AUDIO_IN, U2 pin 7) stays pre-cab-sim on the main board, so detector levels are unchanged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "62216b90-fd6d-5472-ae2e-cd5f2ea19e08")
	)
	(text "STAGES (runoffgroove Condor, JFET gain stage omitted):\nR20/R21: input divider, -6 dB (keeps U1 inside its (V+)-2 V input range on +-2.9 V strums). Full level: R20 = 0R, R21 DNP.\nR5/R6/R7 + C3/C4(+C21): bridged-T notch ~400 Hz (Jensen P10R dip); R7 also gives the +6 dB HF shelf and biases U1A.\nC5/C6/R8/R9 + U1B: Sallen-Key HP, f0 ~80 Hz, Q 1.18 (cab low-end rolloff + ~95 Hz bump).\nR10-R13/C7-C10 + U1C/U1D: two Sallen-Key LPs, f0 3.66 kHz, Q 0.99 each (peak ~2.6 kHz, steep top cut)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.924 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "66424a8b-547b-5692-8a62-1586037a5291")
	)
	(text "BUILD OPTIONS:\nNotch depth: stock C3 1n / C4 15n.  Shallower: 1n5 / 10n.  Much shallower (Marshall): 2n2 / 6n8.\nMarshall voicing: + R8 12k, R9 120k, R10-R13 16k (15k/18k), C7/C9 4n7.  Bass: C5/C6 56n-68n more, 33n-39n less.  Treble: R10-R13 18k more, 27k less.\nU1 alt: OPA4197IPW (same pinout, 1 mA/ch) - but its input-pair handover sits at (V+)-3 V = VMID+1.6 V, inside the signal swing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 161.544 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7b2d3200-8a48-5e4d-836b-1caf44c33b58")
	)
